{"name":"Sunday Drive","hex":"#dcc9ae","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"drive","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To operate a vehicle:\n To operate (a wheeled motorized vehicle).","To operate (a wheeled motorized vehicle)."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Planned, usually long-lasting, effort to achieve something; ability coupled with ambition, determination, and motivation.","Violent or rapid motion; a rushing onward or away;  a forced or hurried dispatch of business."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/drive"}],"entries":[{"title":"Sunday Drive","blocks":[{"text":"Sunday Drive is the fifth studio album by American country music artist Brett Eldredge. It was released on July 10, 2020, via Warner Records."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/e/e0/Eldredge_sunday.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sunday_Drive","wikidata":"Q97359883"},{"title":"Sunday drive","blocks":[{"text":"A Sunday drive is an automobile trip, primarily in the United States, Australia and New Zealand, although also recognised in the United Kingdom and elsewhere, typically taken for pleasure or leisure on a Sunday, usually in the afternoon. During the Sunday drive, there is typically no destination and no rush."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sunday_drive","wikidata":"Q7639605"},{"title":"Sunday","blocks":[{"text":"Sunday is the day of the week between Saturday and Monday. Sunday is a day of rest in most Western countries and a part of the weekend. In some Arab countries, Sunday is a weekday."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/dd/Pierre-Le-Moyne-De-l%27art-de-regner_MGG_0910.tif/lossy-page1-330px-Pierre-Le-Moyne-De-l%27art-de-regner_MGG_0910.tif.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sunday","wikidata":"Q132"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https: